IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INSPECT-CONCEPT.

DATA DIVISION.
      WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      01 WS-STR PIC X(14) VALUE "HELLO EVERYONE".
      01 WS-COUNT PIC 99 VALUE 0.
      01 WS-NAME PIC X(5) VALUE "hello".

PROCEDURE DIVISON.
      INSPECT WS-STR TALLYING WS-COUNT FOR ALL "E".
      DISPLAY WS-COUNT.
      INSPECT WS-STR REPLACING ALL "E" BY "A".
      DISPLAY WS-STR.
      INSPECT WS-NAME CONVERTING "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz" TO "ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ".
      DISPLAY WS-NAME.
STOP RUN.
